# Admin Components

## Component Structure

```
src/components/features/admin/
├── analytics-dashboard.tsx    # Main dashboard with tabs and overview
├── analytics-charts.tsx       # Recharts-based charts (line, bar, area)
├── analytics-shared.tsx       # Shared components (CompactStat, formatters)
├── analytics-types.ts         # TypeScript types for analytics data
├── alerts-panel.tsx           # Active alerts display
├── error-detail-sheet.tsx     # Error details slide-out panel
├── item-analytics-modal.tsx   # Per-item analytics modal
└── tabs/
    ├── index.ts               # Export hub
    ├── traffic-tab.tsx        # Traffic analytics (page views, sessions)
    ├── ai-tab.tsx             # AI/LLM usage analytics
    ├── lambda-tab.tsx         # AWS Lambda metrics
    ├── performance-tab.tsx    # Performance metrics (Core Web Vitals)
    ├── system-tab.tsx         # System health monitoring
    ├── database-tab.tsx       # Database metrics
    └── users-tab.tsx          # User analytics
```

## Analytics Dashboard

The main dashboard component with tabbed navigation:

```tsx
import { AnalyticsDashboard } from "@/components/features/admin";

// In admin page
<AnalyticsDashboard />
```

**Features:**
- Uses TanStack Query for data fetching
- Time range selector (1h, 24h, 7d, 30d)
- Tab-based navigation between analytics categories
- Collapsible alerts panel
- Auto-refresh with configurable interval

**Time Range Pattern:**
```tsx
type TimeRange = "1h" | "24h" | "7d" | "30d";

const [range, setRange] = useState<TimeRange>("24h");

<Select value={range} onValueChange={setRange}>
  <SelectTrigger className="w-[120px]">
    <SelectValue />
  </SelectTrigger>
  <SelectContent>
    <SelectItem value="1h">Last Hour</SelectItem>
    <SelectItem value="24h">Last 24h</SelectItem>
    <SelectItem value="7d">Last 7 Days</SelectItem>
    <SelectItem value="30d">Last 30 Days</SelectItem>
  </SelectContent>
</Select>
```

## Analytics Charts

Chart components using Recharts library:

```tsx
import {
  LineChart,
  BarChart,
  AreaChart,
  PieChart,
} from "@/components/features/admin/analytics-charts";

// Line chart for time series data
<LineChart
  data={pageViewsData}
  xKey="timestamp"
  yKey="views"
  color="hsl(var(--brand))"
  height={200}
/>

// Bar chart for categorical data
<BarChart
  data={topPagesData}
  xKey="path"
  yKey="views"
  color="hsl(var(--brand))"
/>

// Area chart for cumulative metrics
<AreaChart
  data={sessionsData}
  xKey="timestamp"
  yKey="sessions"
  gradientFrom="hsl(var(--brand))"
  gradientTo="transparent"
/>
```

**Chart styling guidelines:**
- Use CSS variables for colors (`hsl(var(--brand))`)
- Consistent height across similar charts
- Responsive containers with `ResponsiveContainer`
- Tooltip with custom formatting

## Shared Components

```tsx
import {
  CompactStat,
  getTimeAgo,
  formatAlertValue,
} from "@/components/features/admin/analytics-shared";

// Compact stat card
<CompactStat
  label="Page Views"
  value={12500}
  change={+15.2}  // Percentage change
  trend="up"
/>

// Time formatting
getTimeAgo(timestamp)  // "2 hours ago", "3 days ago"

// Alert value formatting
formatAlertValue(value, type)  // Formats based on metric type
```

**CompactStat design:**
```tsx
function CompactStat({ label, value, change, trend }) {
  return (
    <div className="rounded-lg border bg-card p-3">
      <p className="text-xs text-muted-foreground">{label}</p>
      <p className="text-2xl font-bold">{formatNumber(value)}</p>
      {change && (
        <div className={cn(
          "flex items-center gap-1 text-xs",
          trend === "up" ? "text-emerald-500" : "text-red-500"
        )}>
          {trend === "up" ? <TrendingUp /> : <TrendingDown />}
          {Math.abs(change)}%
        </div>
      )}
    </div>
  );
}
```

